From 59f72b59234f1b0c613856d34ed6cdcacdaf1904 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: =?UTF-8?q?Bruno=20Greg=C3=B3rio?= <accounts@bruno.pw>
Date: Wed, 14 Oct 2026 23:45:29 -0300
Subject: [PATCH] Add the REE time listener, 11

Egis' fingerprint TA on the Sony Xperia 10 VI asks listener 11 for the
wall clock while it initialises its sensor, and the initialisation fails
when nobody answers. Implement Qualcomm's time service protocol as
minkipc's listeners/libtimeservice does: GET_UTC_SEC, GET_SYSTIME,
GET_TIME_MS, GET_HLOS_UTC and END, replied in place.
---
